            "precision_class": "advisory",
            "finding_class": "inaccuracy",
            "failure_scenario": "G-1's rename plan counts `name =` keys as lib renames to perform; a comment counted as a key becomes a phantom eighth `[lib] name` site that no manifest carries, and the checklist cannot close.",
